{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"八年春正月癸未，烏古敵烈部詳穩耶律巢等奏克北邊捷。以戰多殺人，飯僧南京、中京。甲申，如魚兒濼。壬寅，昏霧連日。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"二月丙辰，北、南樞密院言無事可陳。壬戌，以討北部功，烏古敵烈部詳穩耶律巢知北院大王事，都監蕭阿魯帶烏古敵烈部詳穩，加左監門衛上將軍。戊辰，歲饑，免武安州租稅，振恩、蔚、順、惠等州民。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"三月癸卯，有司奏春、泰、寧江三州三千餘人願為僧尼，受具足戒，許之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"夏四月壬子，振義、饒二州民。丁巳，駐蹕塔里捨。己卯，清暑拖古烈。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"五月壬午，晉王仁先薨。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"六月甲寅，振易州貧民。己未，振中京。甲子，振興中府。甲戌，封北府宰相楊績為趙王，樞密副使耶律觀參知政事兼知南院樞密使事。丁丑，高麗遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"秋七月己卯，慶州靳文高八世同居，詔賜爵。丙申，振饒州饑民。丁酉，幸黑嶺。丁未，以御書華嚴經五頌出示群臣。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"閏月辛未，射熊于羖羊山。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"八月庚辰，混同郡王侯古薨，遣使致祭。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九月甲子，駐蹕藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"冬十月己丑，參知政事耶律觀矯制營私第，降為庶人。癸巳，回鶻來貢。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十一月庚戌，免祖州稅。丙辰，大雪，許民樵採禁地。丁卯，賜延昌宮貧戶錢。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十二月戊辰，漢人行宮都部署耶律仲禧封韓國公，樞密副使、參知政事趙徽出為武定軍節度使，樞密副使柴德滋參知政事，漢人行宮副部署耶律大悲奴陞都部署，同知南院樞密使事蕭韓家奴知左夷離畢事。丁丑，以坤寧節，大赦。庚寅，賜高麗佛經一藏。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九年春正月丁未，如雙濼。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"夏四月壬辰，如旺國崖。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"秋七月甲辰，獵大熊山。戊申，烏古敵烈統軍言，八石烈敵烈人殺其節度使以叛。己酉，詔隗烏古部軍分道擊之。丙寅，南京奏歸義、淶水兩縣蝗飛入宋境，餘為蜂所食。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"八月丙申，以耶律仲禧為南院樞密使。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九月癸卯，駐蹕獨盧金。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"冬十月，幸陰山，遂如西京。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十一月戊午，詔行幸之地免租一年。甲子，南院大王合理只致仕。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十二月辛未，以知北院樞密使事耶律宜新為中京留守，南院宣徽使耶律撒剌為南院大王。壬辰，高麗、夏國並遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十年春正月乙卯，如鴛鴦濼。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"二月癸未，蠲平州復業民租賦。戊子，阻卜來貢。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"三月甲子，如拖古烈。以耶律巢為北院大王。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"夏四月，旱。辛未，以奚人達魯三世同居，賜官旌之。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"五月丙寅，錄囚。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"六月戊辰，親出題試進士。壬申，詔臣庶言得失。丙子，御永定殿，策賢良。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"秋七月丙辰，如秋山。癸亥，謁慶陵。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九月庚戌，幸東京，謁二儀、五鸞殿。癸亥，祠木葉山。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"冬十月丁卯，駐蹕藕絲淀。丁丑，詔有司頒行史記、漢書。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十一月戊午，高麗遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十二月辛巳，改明年為大康，大赦。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"大康元年春正月乙未，如混同江。壬寅，振雲州饑。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"二月丁卯，祥州火，遣使恤災。乙酉，駐蹕大魚濼。丁亥，以獲鵝，加鷹坊使耶律楊六為工部尚書。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"三月乙巳，命皇太子寫佛書。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"夏四月丙子，振平州饑。乙酉，如犢山。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"閏月丙午，振平、灤二州饑。庚戌，皇孫延禧生。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"五月甲子，賜妃之親及東宮僚屬爵有差。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"六月癸巳，以興聖宮使奚謝家奴知奚六部大王事。戊戌，知三司使事韓操以錢穀增羨，授三司使。癸卯，遣使按問諸路囚。以惕隱大悲奴為始平軍節度使，參知政事柴德滋武定軍節度使。乙卯，吐蕃來貢。丙辰，詔皇太子總領朝政，仍戒諭之。以武定軍節度使趙徽為南府宰相，樞密副使楊遵勗參知政事。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"秋七月辛酉朔，獵平地松林。丙寅，振南京貧民。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"八月庚寅朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九月乙亥，駐蹕藕絲淀。己卯，以南京饑，免租稅一年，仍出錢粟振之。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"冬十月，西北路酋長遐搭、雛搭、雙古等來降。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十一月辛酉，皇后被誣，賜死；殺伶人趙惟一、高長命，並籍其家屬。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十二月己丑朔，以南京統軍使耶律橤奴為惕隱，漢人行宮都部署耶律霂樞密副使，同知東京留守事蕭鐸剌夷離畢。庚寅，賜張孝傑國姓。壬辰，以西京留守蕭燕六為左夷離畢。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"二年春正月己未，如春水。庚辰，駐蹕雙濼。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"二月戊子，振黃龍府饑。癸丑，南京路饑，免租稅一年。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"三月辛酉，皇太后崩。壬戌，遣殿前副點檢耶律轄古報哀于宋。癸亥，遣使報哀于高麗、夏國。丁卯，大赦。戊寅，以皇太后遺物遣使遺宋、夏。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"夏六月乙酉朔，上大行皇太后尊諡曰仁懿皇后。戊子，宋及高麗、夏國各遣使弔祭。甲午，葬仁懿皇后于慶陵。己亥，駐蹕拖古烈。壬寅，出北院樞密使魏王耶律乙辛為中京留守。丁未，冊皇后蕭氏，封其父祗候郎君鱉里剌為趙王，叔西北路招討使余里也遼西郡王，兄漢人行宮都部署、駙馬都尉霞抹柳城郡王，參知政事楊遵勗知南院樞密使事，北院樞密副使蕭速撒知北院樞密使事，漢人行宮副部署劉詵參知政事。己酉，南府宰相趙徽致仕。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"秋七月戊辰，如秋山。癸酉，柳城郡王霞抹薨。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"八月庚寅，獵，遇麛失其母，憫之，不射。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九月戊午，以南京蝗，免明年租稅。己卯，駐蹕藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"冬十月戊戌，召中京留守魏王耶律乙辛復為北院樞密使。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十一月甲戌，上欲觀起居注，修注郎不攧及忽突菫等不進，各杖二百，罷之，流林牙蕭岩壽於烏隗部。是月，南京地震，民舍多壞。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十二月己丑，以左夷離畢蕭撻不也為南京統軍使。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"三年春正月癸丑，如混同江。乙卯，省諸道春貢金帛，及停周歲所輸尚方銀。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"二月壬午朔，東北路統軍使蕭韓家奴加尚父，封吳王。甲申，詔北院樞密使魏王耶律乙辛同母兄大奴、同母弟阿思世預北、南院樞密之選，其異母諸弟世預夷離菫之選。己丑，如魚兒濼。辛卯，中京饑，罷巡幸。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"夏四月乙酉，泛舟黑龍江。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"五月丙辰，玉田、安次蝝傷稼。癸亥，日中有黑子。己巳，駐蹕犢山。乙亥，北院樞密使耶律乙辛奏，右護衛太保查剌等告知北院樞密使事蕭速撒等八人謀立皇太子，上以無狀，不治，出速撒等三人補外，護衛撒撥等六人各鞭百餘，徙于邊。丙子，以西北路招討使遼西郡王蕭余里也為北府宰相，兼知契丹行宮都部署事。戊寅，詔告謀逆事者，重加官賞。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"六月己卯朔，耶律乙辛令牌印郎君蕭訛都斡誣首嘗預速撒等謀，籍其姓名以告。即命乙辛及耶律仲禧、蕭余里也、耶律孝傑、楊遵勗、燕哥、抄只、蕭十三等鞫治，杖皇太子，囚之宮中。辛巳，殺宿直官敵里剌等三人。壬午，殺宣徽使撻不也等二人。癸未，殺始平軍節度使撒剌等十人，又遣使殺上京留守速撒，及已徙護衛撒撥等六人。乙酉，殺耶律撻不也及其弟陳留。丙戌，廢皇太子為庶人，囚之上京。己丑，回鶻來貢。殺東京留守同知耶律回里不。辛卯，殺速撒等諸子，籍其家。戊申，遣使按五京諸道獄。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"秋七月辛亥，護衛太保查剌加鎮國大將軍，預突呂不部節度使之選，室韋查剌及蕭寶神奴、謀魯古並加左衛大將軍，牌印郎君訛都斡尚皇女趙國公主，授駙馬都尉、始平軍節度使，祗候郎君耶律撻不也及蕭圖古辭並加監門衛上將軍。壬子，知北院樞密副使蕭韓家奴為漢人行宮都部署。乙丑，如秋山。丁丑，謁慶陵。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"八月庚寅，漢人行宮都部署蕭韓家奴薨。辛丑，謁慶陵。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九月癸亥，玉田貢嘉禾。壬申，修乾陵廟。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"冬十月辛丑，駐蹕藕絲淀。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十一月，北院樞密使耶律乙辛遣其私人盜殺庶人濬于上京。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"閏十二月戊午，以北府宰相遼西郡王蕭余里也知北院樞密使事，左夷離畢耶律燕哥為契丹行宮都部署。丙寅，預行正旦禮。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"是歲，南京大熟。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"四年春正月庚辰，如春水。甲午，振東京饑。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"二月乙丑，駐蹕掃獲野。戊辰，以東路統軍使耶律王九為惕隱。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"夏四月辛亥，高麗遣使乞賜鴨淥江以東地，不許。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"五月丙戌，駐蹕散水原。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"六月甲寅，阻卜諸酋長進良馬。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"秋七月甲戌，諸路奏飯僧尼三十六萬。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"八月癸卯，詔有司決滯獄。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"九月乙未，駐蹕藕絲淀。庚子，五國部長來貢。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"冬十月癸卯，以參知政事劉伸為保靜軍節度使。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十一月丁亥，禁士庶服用錦綺、日月、山龍之文。己丑，回鶻遣使來貢。庚寅，南院樞密使耶律仲禧為廣德軍節度使。辛卯，錦州民張寶四世同居，命諸子三班院祗候。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_23_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_23","textTraditional":"十二月丁卯，以北院樞密副使耶律霂知北院樞密使事。","sentenceOrder":78}],"overrides":{}}